ook at the cost of some of these things, it's just -- you know, really disables our country.\par \par \uc2 (CROSSTALK)\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: You said, I'd never do to them what they've done to me. That you -- I'll let you pick it up.\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : I will be tough and I will be fair, and I will be seeking to make America great again.\par \par \uc2 You know, it's an expression that we came up with. I think it's probably the greatest in the history of this country, maybe in the history of the world. MAGA, Make America Great Again.\par \par \uc2 And when I see him, we will stop MAGA. I said, does he have any idea what MAGA means? It means Make America Great Again. And he wants to stop MAGA.\par \par \uc2 I want to make America great again. Our country is in big trouble right now. You look at what we're looking at right now. We're looking at walls and fences.\par \par \uc2 You know, with me, they knew they were going to be invited in. They weren't -- lots of things weren't going to be happening. They are inviting millions of people into our country.\par \par \uc2 And the saddest part is a lot of the people that are being invited in, you don't want in your country. They're very dangerous people.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Let me ask you this, you put out on Truth a statement when the Alabama court came back with the issue of in vitro fertilization, IVF.\par \par \uc2 TRUMP: Yeah, I did.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: I would argue that 2022, a lot of people thought overturning Roe v. Wade would end up being a good thing.\par \par \uc2 TRUMP: Right.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: We know what the Democrats are going to do. They're going to demagogue Republicans like they always do. They're racist, sexist, misogynist, homophobic, all that stuff. But more important, democracy in peril, they hate \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , January 6th, but then the issue of abortion. I think it played a very big part. They demagogued that issue...\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : Yes.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: ... in 2022, in the midterm.\par \par \uc2 TRUMP: Right.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: And I think it hurt Republicans.\par \par \uc2 TRUMP: Uh-huh.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: You took a strong stand on IVF. Where are you on that? And what is your message to other candidates? And where are you on abortion?\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : So I saw the IVF and a judge in Alabama made a very harsh decision. It was very, very tough. And I came out immediately and I said, we want to help women. This is fertilization. This is, they're having a hard time having a baby, to put it very simply. And they are helped by clinics and others. And all of a sudden it was stopped in Alabama. And I put out a very strong statement that we're totally in favor of it.\par \par \uc2 I got a call from Katie Britt, a very wonderful young senator in Alabama. And she said, friends of mine were coming up and like almost attacking her. They were so upset about it. And I said, what's the issue? What is it? Explain. What is it exactly? And we were talking about the IVF. And I said, we want that. We want people to help. We're on the side of women.\par \par \uc2 And same thing on the abortion issue. The abortion issue, now, I'm for the exceptions like \uc2 Ronald Reagan\uc2  was for the exceptions. And I think it's very important they...\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Rape, incest, mother's life.\par \par \uc2 TRUMP: Correct, life of the mother. I think it's a very important thing, the exceptions. I also think that they are the radicals because they will kill the baby in eight months, nine months under Roe v. Wade. They would - - they had the right to kill the baby after birth. I mean, literally, after birth in some cases.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Well, that was the governor of Virginia at the time.\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 : That was, that's right.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: I was talking to your friend, \uc2 Gavin Newsom\uc2 . I asked him four times in a row. I said, are there any, any limitations at all? He would not answer.\par 