2 And on the border, they've handed the agenda over to the extreme left that believes borders are immoral. We should have no border anyone should be able to come into this country. That's who's setting the Biden administration agenda.\par \par \uc2 Number two, the corporate media is utterly corrupt, so they don't report on it. If you watch FOX News, as you and I both do, you know about what's happening on the border. But if you watch CNN, there is no border crisis. ABC, \uc2 CBS\uc2 , NBC, nothing to see here.\par \par \uc2 And number three, it's what you just said, I think a lot of Democrats know there's massive human suffering, but they're willing to overlook that human suffering because they want to stay in power. And they look at the 9.6 million illegal immigrants and they think every one of them is a future Democrat voter, and we get to stay in power if we change the electorate and just allow open borders.\par \par \uc2 And I got to say, Sean, the most dangerous thing, I believe the odds are extraordinarily high that in the year 2024, we will see a major terrorist attack in the United States. There are \uc2 Hamas\uc2  and \uc2 Hezbollah\uc2  terrorists coming across our southern border right now, and \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  and the Democrats in the House and Senate, they do not care.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Well, we know that the possibility -- I say it's 100 percent. We know that we've had hundreds from Iran show up at our southern border. If you're from Iran, Syria, hundreds more from there, what are you doing at our southern border?\par \par \uc2 CRUZ: Yeah.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Thousands from Egypt, the home of the Muslim brotherhood, 6,000, plus from Afghanistan, al-Qaeda. We got over 12,000 from Russia, 26,000 from China.\par \par \uc2 Now, let me be very clear because Democrats say they're racist, they don't want people of color coming into the country. That's -- I don't care where people come, but I'd like people vetted.\par \par \uc2 CRUZ: Yeah.\par \par 