y said, I shall not seek and I will not accept the nomination of my party for another term as your president. Now, despite being an incumbent president who is eligible to run for reelection, Governor Newsom, I've interviewed you twice on this issue.\par \par \uc2 You say you are not running for president in 2024. In fact, you recently said, quote, you think that Vice President Harris is naturally the one lined up to run for president if \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  were to bow out. Governor Newsom, tonight I ask you, will you make an LBJ-like statement and Governor DeSantis, you say he's running a shadow campaign. In your response, I would like you to answer that. Will you say, unequivocally, under no circumstances, are you running?\par \par \uc2 NEWSOM: Correct. I've said, I don't know how many times I can say it, just making this stuff up about a shadow campaign. Bottom line --\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: If at the DNC convention they come and ask you, will you run, what will you say?\par \par \uc2 NEWSOM: \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  will be our nominee in a matter of weeks. And in a matter of weeks, Sean, he'll be endorsing \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  as a nominee for the Republican Party.\par \par \uc2 NEWSOM: If they come to you at the DNC, and Joe is incapable of running and they ask you, are you a hard no?\par \par \uc2 NEWSOM: It's not even optional. He's doing fantastically. I appreciate and respect the work the president's doing and the vice president's, the Biden- Harris campaign and team.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: President Harris will be the next person?\par \par \uc2 NEWSOM: So absolutely unequivocally, I look forward to continuing to support their efforts. President Biden will be re-elected. \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  will be rejected.\par \par \uc2 DESANTIS: I think what he's saying should color every single thing. I mean, I've called them on a lot of the lies, but he says \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  is 100% up to the job. You know that that's not true. Anybody that can look, he wants you to