his latest Iran deal, and now, they're going to free up another $10 billion for Iran? Iran does two things when they get a dollar, they enrich uranium just short of where it needs to be for a nuclear weapon. And secondly, they put it into terrorism.\par \par \uc2 We know they put a hundred million dollars into \uc2 Hamas\uc2 , \uc2 Hezbollah\uc2 , Houthis each individually. We know that they're funding these other militias. We know that they are their proxies and they're carrying out these attacks.\par \par \uc2 And everyone is aware of what is happening. Iran, \uc2 Hamas\uc2 , they all say death to America, death to Israel. It is a part of what they're doing it's why we go fight this every day. It is why we stand with Israel. We have to stand with Israel, and we have to have an administration that will show the world that we will not be deterred in our support of Israel.\par \par \uc2 MCENANY: Yeah, it's fantasy foreign policy, and it's leading to a lot of American death and carnage, Such a tragedy.\par \par \uc2 BLACKBURN: Yes.\par \par \uc2 MCENANY: Senator Blackburn, thank you very much.\par \par \uc2 Straight ahead, American consumers are getting punished by inflation just in time for the holidays -- thank you, \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  -- who does not seem to think all is well. He's selling you on a lie.\par \par \uc2 We'll break it all down as a special edition of "Hannity" continues.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 MCENANY: Welcome back to the special edition of "Hannity".\par \par \uc2 The holiday season is almost here, which means Americans are about to spend a ton of money, even as most are barely getting by. Check out this new survey from \uc2 Lending Club\uc2  which shows a full 60 percent, 60 percent of Americans are living paycheck to paycheck. That includes 42 percent of those who report making six figures. Over a third of respondents say they'll have to tap into savings just to buy gifts. And it makes sense, because prices are up 18 percent