ary city for grizzlies. How soon before they march for free salmon and vote Democrat. But I am for this and I'll tell you why. It will make boring endeavors like hiking all the more thrilling. And you'll agree with me on this because I've talked about it before. It will make murder look like an accident, right? It's another way. So, hey, honey, let's go hiking in the North Cascades Forest.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: Go for a walk.\par \par \uc2 PERINO: Whoops.\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: Whoops.\par \par \uc2 PERINO: I closed my eyes for a minute.\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: Yes.\par \par \uc2 PERINO: Listen to the local people. They know better. And also, pay attention to the folks that had to deal with this with the wolf when it was reintroduced.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: Yes.\par \par \uc2 PERINO: And also, it is Biden's fault because Biden is actually putting this rule forward through the Department of Interior.\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: Oh, I stand corrected.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: All right, admit it, Jessica.\par \par \uc2 TARLOV: Sure. We won so big last night, I don't care.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: All right, "ONE MORE THING" is up next.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: "ONE MORE THING." I'll go first. Tonight, what a show. Charly Arnolt, Chael Sonnen, I love him, Kat Timpf, Tyrus. That's tonight at 10:00 p.m. Let's do this. Greg's Porch Pirate News. You know, you order food. Then it doesn't arrive. Well, look what happened here. They got their order of Taco Bell, and then what happened?\par \par \uc2 TARLOV: Oh, a bear.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: A bear.\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: The Taco Bell was stolen by the bear.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: I love it.\par \par \uc2 WATTERS: Thanks, Biden.\par \par \uc2 GUTFELD: But the joke is on him because just hours later he sprayed the street with explosive diarrhea. Be careful what you steal. All right, Judge.\par \par \uc2 PIRRO: OK. Kevin Bacon, the pig, was on the run for two weeks. After Kevin Bacon, the actor, got wind of the news 