e was in business with a Chinese company to make Chinese medicines, not with an American company to make American medicines, a Chinese company to make Chinese medicines. Then you go and you look at the family he was doing business with. And he turns around and is in business with the family that gave Hunter Biden $5 million. And then he wants to suddenly go and promote TikTok, I don't trust it. I don't trust it every little bit about of that.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: I agree with you on TikTok. I don't trust it either.\par \par \uc2 HALEY: No. But everything, all of this was Chinese Communist Party related. So how do we trust it? And then he suddenly decides not to be in business the second before he decides to run for president? It smells bad. I don't want to appreciate it. And look, we've got a country to say that, trust it.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: I cannot understand about this president. They lie to us and say the borders closed, the border secure. Our eyes do not deceive us, but they continue to lie.\par \par \uc2 HALEY: But I trust the American --\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: And how does China get away with let's see, a spy balloon flying all across the continental U.S. over our military installation? Why don't we let them buy thousands and thousands of acres of farmland and ranch land? Why are they confronting our mil -- of our Air Force in international, you know, airways and our Navy and international waterways and there are no consequences, why?\par \par \uc2 HALEY: I mean look, I mean this was the whole issue that I have with President Trump, he was great on trade. He never held them accountable for COVID. He never did anything about the fentanyl coming across. He didn't stop them buying our land. There was a Chinese spy base in Cuba. He didn't do anything about that. This is our number one national security threat.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: He did get for the first time that I think I know of in history, he certainly had them pay their fair share when it came to tr