d somebody else to be on the ticket.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: What about the Joe part, \uc2 Ari Fleischer\uc2 ? It's lies repeatedly as a candidate, as a president about never speaking to Hunter, his brother, or anybody for that matter?\par \par \uc2 Then, we find all these meetings that take place in the -- in the White House with his, you know, with Hunter's partners here in America. Then we have all the phone calls that Devon Archer talked about with Hunter and his foreign business partners. Then you have the meetings with like the Russian oligarch and others at Cafe Milano, a Russian oligarch? What did Hunter do? Why this -- why the suspicious activity reports 170? Why the shell corporations?\par \par \uc2 How did nine Biden family members get paid? What did Hunter do when he admits he had no experience and admits he was an addict at the time? What did the grandchildren that Comer says got paid, what did they do for their money?\par \par \uc2 Any of this make sense to you?\par \par \uc2 ARI FLEISCHER\uc2 , FOX NEWS CONTRIBUTOR: Oh, sure, it makes sense. That's what you do if you're the president's son and your last name is Biden. No other president's son has done this kind of thing.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Well, maybe he can adopt me, I'll be pretty rich.\par \par \uc2 FLEISCHER: Sean, you're better than a Biden. We all know that.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: That was a joke, yeah.\par \par \uc2 FLEISCHER: But listen, here's the -- here's the problem that I have with all of this. \uc2 Hunter Biden\uc2  said that his father -- I'm sorry, wasn't Hunter who said it.\par \par \uc2 The people making the accusations against \uc2 Hunter Biden\uc2  are who? It's not Jim Jordan. It's not Republicans. It's Hunter's business partners. It's the people who he worked with, who know the facts, who are on the inside -- these aren't partisan Republicans. They're eyewitnesses.\par \par \uc2 And what did they say? They testified under oath that \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  20 times got on the phone