the government down for 24 or 48 hours, what I call a long holiday weekend, they will tell you the sky's falling. Why? because they've created this centralized Washington, D.C. massively powerful and ubiquitous unelected government. So even when they lose elections, their policies are implemented, and the Republican president is sabotaged by this massive bureaucracy.\par \par \uc2 But take a look at the Democrat Party. \uc2 Woodrow Wilson\uc2 , \uc2 Franklin Roosevelt\uc2 , Lyndon Johnson, \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 , more. You today, you have \uc2 Bernie Sanders\uc2 . \uc2 Bernie Sanders\uc2  is a Marxist. He almost won the nomination to the Democrat Party.\par \par \uc2 He's had more influence on the Biden regime than anybody else than perhaps Obama. And what is Obama? Obama's mentor was a Marxist. Obama hung out with domestic terrorists as you reported over and over and over again.\par \par \uc2 But who else is there? You've got AOC, Tlaib, Omar, Priestly, Bowman, two dozen individuals in the House of Representatives who are Marxists, and they're proud of being Marxists.\par \par \uc2 Now, they don't call themselves Marxists. They're shrewd, but they are what they are.\par \par \uc2 So the Democrat party is all about whether it's years ago or today, abolishing our declaration of independence. \uc2 Woodrow Wilson\uc2  hated the Declaration of Independence. Obama used to cut words out of the Declaration of Independence. Biden doesn't support the Declaration of Independence. He doesn't even say he does.\par \par \uc2 They despise the Constitution which is why they embrace the 1619 project, pulling down the Founders statues, calling us a nation founded in white supremacy even up to this day. They want to abolish our traditions, our customs.\par \par \uc2 They're trying to destroy our language. They use censorship. They use intimidation.\par \par \uc2 More, again it's more than a political party. It's an autocratic party. It is a tyrannical party, which is similar to these ki