here millions of people around the world use to immerse themselves. They would do that before ascending the monumental pilgrimage road up there, about a half-mile up to the Temple Mount. The newly restored site will be open to the public for the first time in two millennia very soon.\par \par \uc2 Tomorrow on SPECIAL REPORT, we hear from the son of a Hong Kong democracy activist and media tycoon. He's been held in Chinese custody for three years. That's tomorrow.\par \par \uc2 END\par \par \uc2 Content and Programming Copyright 2023 Fox News Network, LLC. ALL  RIGHTS RESERVED. Copyright 2023 VIQ Media Transcription, Inc.  All  materials herein are protected by United States copyright law and may not  be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, displayed, published or broadcast  without the prior written permission of VIQ Media Transcription, Inc. You  may not alter or remove any trademark, copyright or other notice from  copies of the content. \par \par \uc2 Document FNSPBB0020230908ej9700001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 News; Domestic\par \b \uc2 Prosecutors To Seek Hunter Indictment By September 29; Special Counsel Plans On Indicting \uc2 Hunter Biden\uc2 ; Media Finally Acknowledging Hunter's Legal Woes; Navy Secretary Accuses Senator Of Aiding Communists; Navy Secretary Accuses Senator Of Aiding Communist; Military Leaders Speak Out Against Senator Tuberville; Frantic Manhunt Underway For Escaped Killer; Cult Of COVID Maskers Push New Mandate; Masks Making A Comeback Ahead Of Illegal Immigration Takes Toll On Manhattan; Kamala Says She's Ready To Be President; White House Cites COVID Precautions For Biden's Early Exit\b0\par\par\uc2 Laura Ingraham, Sol Wisenberg, Kevin Corke, Raymond Arroyo Bret Baier, Laura Ingraham, Sol Wisenberg \par \uc2 7,902 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 September 2023\par \uc2 Fox News: The Ingraham Angle\par \uc2 INGANG\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Content and Programming Copyright 2023 Fox News Network, LLC. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED. Copyright 2023 ASC Servi