oung, generational conservative that's going to go and clean up what they've done to \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , but also carry our country forward.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Governor, always great to see you. We appreciate you coming by. Thank you.\par \par \uc2 HALEY: Thank you so much.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: OK. Coming up, former Vice President \uc2 Mike Pence\uc2 , he'll join us live from the spin room. More reaction to the first GOP presidential debate as we continue. Thank you for being with Fox and "HANNITY."\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: All right, in 2020, Vice President \uc2 Mike Pence\uc2  absolutely demolished \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  during their debate. So, how did he do tonight against his fellow Republicans? Let's take a look.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 PENCE: Martha, you asked earlier who's the most best prepared for this job. And I must say, with all due respect to all of my friends on the stage, and even to one that's probably looking on, I think unquestionably, I am the best prepared, the most tested, the most qualified and proven conservative in this race. I was a leader in the \uc2 Congress of the United States\uc2 . I led Indiana where we balanced budgets and had a triple A bond rating -- when I was governor. And as Vice President of the United States, we spent funding to backfill on the military cuts of the Obama administration, and then we were there in the worst pandemic in a hundred years.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: All right, here with us now, former Vice President \uc2 Mike Pence\uc2 . Mr. Vice President, how are you? Good to see you again.\par \par \uc2 PENCE: I'm great, Sean.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: Thank you for being here.\par \par \uc2 PENCE: Thank you.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: You know on the best prepared, most tested, and then you know a little exchange with Vivek and it was over this issue, he actually said it's not time for on the job training, not time for a rookie 