ut other than you.\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: I'm getting an old key, you know, just a regular car, Andrea, from like 1978 with no chip in it. I don't want -- I want -- I'm going to get rid of all the -- honestly, I'm going to go find like a 1978, you know, whatever I can find that doesn't have any chip. At this point, that's where I'm going backward.\par \par \uc2 Yeah, I mean, that's what I'm going to do. Andrea, thank you, great to see you tonight. All right, now it's time for our political palate cleanser. Now --\par \par \uc2 What happens when I leave my natural habitat of orange theory, hiking, tennis? Well, I found out today at Edwin Watts Golf Store looking for clubs for my 15-year-old.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: OK, I am having a case of vertigo. I am not a golfer. And I am just seeing golf everywhere. Use clubs, old clubs, wedges, hybrids. Everything is golf. Insane.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: I've never seen anything like this. Thanks to Ryan for helping us, but I'm still dizzy. All right, Biden's lack of understanding is wider than the Grand Canyon. And Lizzo's dancers accuse her of being the heavy. Did their accusations shut down a music festival? Raymond Arroyo has all the details. Seen and Unseen, next.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 INGRAHAM: It's time for our Seen and Unseen segment where we reveal the cultural stories of the day. And for that, we turn to Fox News contributor, Raymond Arroyo. All right, Raymond, Biden finally sat for an interview. Was it stormy?\par \par \uc2 RAYMOND ARROYO, FOX NEWS CONTRIBUTOR: Yeah, it was with the \uc2 Weather Channel\uc2 , which makes sense, Laura. Remember, Hunter's lawyer said about Biden's conversations with his son's business partners this.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 UNKNOWN: Approximately 20 times over the course of 10-year relationship, Hunter may have put his father on the phone with any number of different people 