uc2  territory. And that includes Finland obviously.\par \par \uc2 HEINRICH (voice over): President Biden capping off a three country trip to strengthen the \uc2 NATO\uc2  alliance with a stop and its newest member state in Russia's backyard.\par \par \uc2 BIDEN: Working in lockstep to set us on a stronger, safer and more secure path, not just for Europe, not just for \uc2 NATO\uc2 , but for the world.\par \par \uc2 HEINRICH (voice over): Lauding Sweden's progress joining the alliance, Biden made clear Ukraine's path has a roadblock.\par \par \uc2 BIDEN: No one can join \uc2 NATO\uc2  while the war -- a war is going on, because that guarantees that we're in a war, we're in a third world war.\par \par \uc2 HEINRICH (voice over): Contrasting with what national security adviser Jake Sullivan said yesterday, denying Biden believes the war must first end and saying we obviously retained flexibility.\par \par \uc2 Biden offered reassurance over Ukraine's timeline, especially with security pledges from allies proclaiming Russia has already lost.\par \par \uc2 BIDEN: My expectation is you'll see that Ukraine makes significant progress on their offensive and that generates a negotiated settlement somewhere along the line.\par \par \uc2 HEINRICH (voice over): The last American president to visit Helsinki made headlines when Trump side with the Kremlin over American intelligence when asked if Russia interfered in the 2016 election.\par \par \uc2 DONALD TRUMP\uc2 , FORMER PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES: He just said it's not Russia. I will say this, I don't see any reason why it would be.\par \par \uc2 HEINRICH (voice over): Biden not wasting an opportunity to show American leadership has changed.\par \par \uc2 BIDEN: They've already interfered in American elections.\par \par \uc2 HEINRICH (voice over): Also offering the alliance reassurance about America's future role, even as his own chances at a second term are unclear.\par \par \uc2 BIDEN: I absolutely guarantee there is no